{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X的大块直接交代人物当下的状态、原因和转折，单看就能串起故事；Y只放大关键词，部分因果关系和具体处境需要依赖未放大的文字。small：Y的小字更常把听感与人物处境联系起来，提供了较多有用的补充；X的小字虽然具体，但有些意象与人物处境的联系稍弱。core：平，两版都持续呈现不愿再受委屈与怀念旧日生活、亲近关系之间的拉扯，最后也都落在带着想念继续生活。concise：X，Y的小字有不少层层解释心慌、失落和无答案的内容，部分情绪已经表达过又换一种说法重复；X相对收敛。human：X，Y有“活动感像暂时侧身离开沉重的问题”“前进感越来越不可避免”“愿望向远方发出”等搭配，抽象、生硬，不太符合日常表达习惯。fine：X的身体反应和场景意象更直接地呈现观众此刻的具体体验；Y有较多音乐本身的描述和抽象阐释，真正落在观众感受上的内容相对不够集中。load：Y的高亮块虽然数量较多，但大多短小，切分也基本自然；X有些短停留屏需要扫读好几条较长的大块，负担更重。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2773a735-2e80-4bf5-860a-6cc2b583263b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T203952126061Z", "elapsed_seconds": 220.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T20:43:32.395478+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d54151173ac4971566252c8143e2ce2e385632afb120a80abda894b02ed6bc66", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\c